#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:5
#: ef7f3f4a62034e19beb4c15bdc785afe
msgid "STorM32 Gimbal Controller"
msgstr "STorM32 云台控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:7
#: 3b8b1315e38d487782598fd52db6a25f
msgid ""
"The STorM32-BGC is a relatively low-cost 3-axis brushless gimbal controller "
"that can communicate with ArduPilot (Copter, Plane and Rover) using MAVLink "
"or a proprietary serial protocol."
msgstr ""
"STorM32-BGC 是一款相对低成本的三轴无刷云台控制器，可通过 MAVLink 或专有串行协议与 ArduPilot（Copter、Plane 和"
" Rover）通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:11
#: 7fcb5d90163d44e2b5690395e4f5e2fb
msgid ""
"SToRM32 gimbals with I2C setups and firmware v0.96 should use the SToRM32 "
"Serial driver"
msgstr "使用 I2C 配置和固件 v0.96 的 SToRM32 云台应使用 SToRM32 串行驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:12
#: b1553e5099b6409d8eb0317bbb398b6c
msgid ""
"SToRM32 NT gimbals running firmware above v0.96 should use the SToRM32 "
"MAVLink driver"
msgstr "运行 v0.96 以上固件的 SToRM32 NT 云台应使用 SToRM32 MAVLink 驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:15
#: b90b15ca9795494c97ce4a7a7b28d113
msgid "Where to buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:17
#: 9311d8b130444dbf833f389cfd7dad7d
msgid ""
"Please refer to the `STorM32-BGC wiki pages <http://www.olliw.eu/storm32bgc-"
"wiki/Main_Page>`__ for more detailed information including where the gimbals"
" can be purchased."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `STorM32-BGC wiki 页面 <http://www.olliw.eu/storm32bgc-wiki/Main_Page>`__ "
"获取更多详细信息，包括云台的购买渠道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:21
#: c20198b5783a44298a1a739e5d66664e
msgid ""
"Some v1.3x boards has been found to cause significant RF interference on the"
" 433mhz and 915mhz band. Use with caution, if you are using either "
"433/915mhz control or telemetry."
msgstr ""
"部分 v1.3x 版本的板子被发现会对 433MHz 和 915MHz 频段造成明显射频干扰。若您使用 433/915MHz 遥控或数传，请谨慎使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:25
#: 334dd08008654015b1137973362ff33a
msgid "Connecting the gimbal to the autopilot"
msgstr "将云台连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:30
#: 6aa9c7e9079d4224ac120cdc80f7c0a9
msgid ""
"Connect one of the  autopilot's serial port's TX, RX and GND pins to the "
"gimbal's UART port as shown above.  The autopilot's serial port's VCC, RTS "
"and CTS pins should not be connected"
msgstr "如上图所示，将飞控串口的 TX、RX 和 GND 引脚连接到云台的 UART 接口。飞控串口的 VCC、RTS 和 CTS 引脚无需连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:35
#: 70d236e0a2e24dc7bfb5b30416a0b68c
msgid "Setup if using MAVLink protocol"
msgstr "使用 MAVLink 协议时的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:37
#: 1bfc03ec0b664da995825675ee8bb552
msgid ""
"In addition to the regular gimbal configuration described on the "
"`STorM32-BGC wiki <http://www.olliw.eu/storm32bgc-wiki/Getting_Started>`__, "
"the MAVlink heartbeats should be enabled through OlliW's o323BGCTool's "
"**Tools \\| Expert Tool** screen as shown below."
msgstr ""
"除 `STorM32-BGC wiki <http://www.olliw.eu/storm32bgc-wiki/Getting_Started>`__"
" 上描述的常规云台配置外，还需通过 OlliW 的 o323BGCTool 的 **工具 \\| 专家工具** 界面（如下图所示）启用 MAVLink "
"心跳包。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:45
#: 856c59e7d7ff4f4f8dc4bf821aba81ac
msgid ""
"Using a ground station (e.g. Mission Planner) set the following parameters."
"  These setting assume Autopilot's serial2 is being used.  If another serial"
" port is being used replace the \"2\" in the parameter name with the "
"appropriate serial port number."
msgstr ""
"使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）设置以下参数。这些设置假定使用飞控的 serial2。若使用其他串口，请将参数名中的 「2」 "
"替换为相应的串口编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:47
#: 362261d7c8ef4158a4ec28c42c4d0299
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 bps)."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 bps）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:48
#: ae47120e80014c4aaebdbad74564b0ac
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink1) or 2 (MAVLink2)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1（MAVLink1）或 2（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:49
#: c15ad3b4ce0144afa3a1d9d98aa2e7e8
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0 to disable "
"serial flow control"
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0 以禁用串口流控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:54
#: 2a0dc0f4964e4dd494849965c443549f
msgid "if the first mount is being used, set the following parameters:"
msgstr "若使用第一个挂载点，设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:56
#: 5a9db91ce22a446d81f8d4c70ba77525
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 4 (SToRM32 MAVLink) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 4（SToRM32 MAVLink），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:57
#: 119e7c6faab143729d535e21b81e4242
msgid ""
"set :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX "
"<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>`, :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX"
" <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` to match your gimbal's range."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX "
"<MNT1_YAW_MAX>`、:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX "
"<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>`、:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX "
"<MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` 以匹配您云台的运动范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:58
#: cc030a486a2c432daeb4b8d881824fd8
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 to control the gimbal's "
"pitch from the transmitter's ch6 tuning knob."
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213，以通过遥控器第6通道调节旋钮控制云台俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:60
#: 8ceb52d85fdf4b8ca0b704b4bd1e7bef
msgid "The screenshot below shows a setup in which the gimbal has:"
msgstr "下方截图展示了一个云台设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:62
#: e0996b9eb6144e9897047a78c6dc1c7e
msgid ""
"360 of yaw rotation (:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` = -180, "
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>`  = 179)"
msgstr ""
"360度偏航旋转（:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` = -180，:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX "
"<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` = 179）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:63
#: c294ab6a94d648f7b39c500796b1dced
msgid ""
"60 degrees (both left and right) of roll (:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN "
"<MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` = -60, :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>`  = +60)"
msgstr ""
"左右各60度横滚（:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` = -60，:ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX "
"<MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` = +60）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:64
#: d14070400094445b8a39680768087cc3
msgid ""
"Can point straight down (:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` = -9000)"
msgstr "可垂直向下（:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` = -9000）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:65
#: 3451f581aa914e3b800f82b9f50ec66d
msgid "Can point straight up (:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` = +90)"
msgstr "可垂直向上（:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` = +90）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:66
#: 412895ca099b4145abdd470cc1024bad
msgid ""
"Gimbal's pitch is controlled by the transmitter's channel 6 tuning knob"
msgstr "云台俯仰由遥控器第6通道调节旋钮控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:72
#: abc9f6014ea244c7b9f7a5e274ba2697
msgid "Setup if using SToRM32 Serial protocol"
msgstr "使用 SToRM32 串行协议时的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:74
#: 5590ae7e70464269b1e4babedecded44
msgid "To use the serial protocol use all the same settings as above except:"
msgstr "使用串行协议时，所有设置与上述相同，除了以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:76
#: 02bef358773e4ce18b75a42ced488395
msgid ""
"When :ref:`Configuring the Gimbal <common-"
"storm32-gimbal_configuring_the_gimbal>` controller set the \"MAVLink "
"configuration\" parameter to \"no heartbeat\""
msgstr ""
":ref:`配置云台 <common-storm32-gimbal_configuring_the_gimbal>` 控制器时，将 「MAVLink "
"configuration」 参数设置为 「no heartbeat」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:77
#: dd7a69ef89f44aebafc7ff67c842e9e2
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (SToRM32 Gimbal Serial).  If "
"another serial port is connected to the gimbal replace \"2\" with the serial"
" port number"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 8（SToRM32 云台串行）。若另一个串口连接云台，将 "
"「2」 替换为该串口编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:78
#: 107468d1dce0465cb62659d27236b280
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 5 (SToRM32 Serial)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` = 5（SToRM32 串行）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:81
#: 58c70d6f2774458dabfc19ffdc5e1c34
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr "控制与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:83
#: c1b1174bd1e148f8a949334bccfb7d56
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` for details on "
