#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:86
#: 92c759067d30444486c08fcda7653251
msgid "Resistor issue on some boards"
msgstr "部分板子的电阻问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-storm32-gimbal.rst:88
#: ce27e8a93acf4a4d83ff10127c2a5fd2
msgid ""
"Some in-depth analysis `here on rcgroups "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2494532-Storm32-with-"
"Pixhawk-over-serial-connection/page5>`__ turned up that some STorM32 boards "
"need resistor #4 (shown in pic below) shorted (i.e. a wire soldered over the"
" top of the resistor to turn it into a regular wire) in order for the gimbal"
" controllers messages to get through to the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"rcgroups 上的 `深度分析 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2494532-Storm32-with-"
"Pixhawk-over-serial-connection/page5>`__ 发现，部分 STorM32 板子需要将电阻 "
"#4（见下图）短路（即在电阻上焊接一根导线使其变为普通导线），才能使云台控制器的消息传达到 Pixhawk。"
